    {
      "id": "u_9762d54133a7de9aecc50bcf_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A Trilium instance represents a server. If __TRILIUM_PH_0__Synchronization__TRILIUM_PH_1__ is set up, since multiple servers are involved (the one from the desktop client and the one the synchronisation is set up with), sometimes it can be useful to distinguish the instance you are running on.",
      "sourceHash": "9762d54133a7de9aecc50bcffb4cd26311f921a356d5d18676aad043cd13ee81",
      "context": "Trilium instance",
      "contextHash": "f3e2c78db4acb4acde4599d9e0af565b23b5106fe54c17d177996ad210ec4ff3",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Triliumインスタンスはサーバーを表します。__TRILIUM_PH_0__同期__TRILIUM_PH_1__が設定されている場合、複数のサーバー（デスクトップクライアント側のサーバーと、同期を設定したサーバー）が関与するため、実行中のインスタンスを区別すると便利な場合があります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
