    {
      "id": "u_3358b07950959611b9e3750c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Use __TRILIUM_PH_0__ to obtain the instance name of the current server, as specified in the config file or in environment variables.",
      "sourceHash": "3358b07950959611b9e3750c70aae49aedeb44c07337a6fd074a31a510e1b806",
      "context": "Trilium instance > Distinguishing the instance on back-end",
      "contextHash": "53fb858796ea708bccc8793539f335a54db95c2457b1e58642a3c1edaeaf5ecd",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "設定ファイルまたは環境変数で指定されている現在のサーバーのインスタンス名を取得するには、__TRILIUM_PH_0__を使用します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
