    {
      "id": "u_e6962e2981ef725f58086f98_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For a script that is run periodically or on a certain event, it's possible to limit it to certain instances without having to change the code. Just add __TRILIUM_PH_0__ and set as the value the instance name where the script should run. To run on multiple named instances, simply add the label multiple times.",
      "sourceHash": "e6962e2981ef725f58086f98b8f2a3682a21d813062698a91a240feb1d3bceed",
      "context": "Trilium instance > Limiting script runs based on instance",
      "contextHash": "067309013fddd59ad967ab106ee0220985fa9d1c4a351db65a14bb13cf23d2d9",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "定期的に、または特定のイベントで実行されるスクリプトの場合、コードを変更することなく特定のインスタンスに実行を制限することができます。__TRILIUM_PH_0__を追加し、値をスクリプトを実行するインスタンス名に設定するだけです。複数の名前付きインスタンスで実行するには、単にラベルを複数回追加します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
